{"unit_id":"longyu065__dsh-theme-ti#feature-1","repo":"longyu065/dsh-theme-ti","commit":"62ae2e761f045387617e28828e4b533626b3156e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-theme/ti 的功能「TI6 双模式配色」：插件通过 theme.overrideTokens 覆盖一组浅色和深色 token，替换界面底色、文字、按钮与状态颜色，同时保留当前主题偏好。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:69-179","client.js:570-574"]}
