{"unit_id":"longyu065__dsh-theme-ti#feature-3","repo":"longyu065/dsh-theme-ti","commit":"62ae2e761f045387617e28828e4b533626b3156e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-theme/ti 的功能「可开关的丝带动画」：加载后在画布上绘制飘动红丝带、翅膀水印和 TI6 徽标；用户可在设置页切换动画层，停用时清理计时器和画布。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:511-543","client.js:581-614","client.js:616-650"]}
